---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const updated = '26 November 2026';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How MeepleMath handles your data, cookies and advertising.">
  <article class="prose-mm max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <h2>Your game data stays on your device</h2>
    <p>
      Scores, player names, saved games and stats are stored in your browser's local storage and IndexedDB. They are
      never sent to MeepleMath. Clearing your browser data, or using "Delete all" on the history page, removes them.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views. It does not use cookies or track you across sites. See
      <a class="underline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
    <p>
      MeepleMath is funded by ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies to serve ads based on
      your previous visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalised advertising in
      <a class="underline" href="https://adssettings.google.com/">Google's Ads Settings</a>. Learn how Google uses
      information from sites that use its services at
      <a class="underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Visitors in the European Economic Area, the UK and Switzerland are asked for consent through Google's certified
      consent message before personalised ads are shown, and can change their choice at any time from the privacy
      link it adds to the page.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about privacy: <a class="underline" href="mailto:hello@meeplemath.org">hello@meeplemath.org</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
